      "releaseNotes": "Every pet is now one of a kind.\n\n• Personality — each pet is born Sleepy, Playful, Foodie, Shy or Curious, and it\n  shows in everything it does.\n• Yesterday with your pet — a little card each morning: your steps, your care, and\n  what your pet got up to.\n• Favourite treats — every pet loves one snack and isn't keen on another. Find out\n  which by feeding!\n• Treasures — your pet brings little finds home from your walks. Collect all 12.\n• Trains and sleeps with you — after a workout your pet is bursting with energy, and\n  it learns your bedtime so it sleeps when you do.\n• Close your rings, feed your pet — every Activity ring you close is a feast.\n• Care streaks and 13 milestones — a missed day won't wipe your streak: leaves you\n  earn along the way protect it.\n• Grow-up styles — the way you care shapes your pet's adult look: cuddly, sporty,\n  chubby or balanced.\n• Seasons — blossom in spring, orange leaves in autumn, a cosy scarf in winter.\n• Two new species — Sunny and the rare Frosty. A gold-speckled egg means\n  something special is inside.\n• Little fixes.",
