      "releaseNotes": "A new world: the Seaside!\n\n• Take your pet to a beach at sunset that moves: clouds drift, the tide rolls in, the sea sparkles.\n• It sails out in its own boat and goes fishing. The more you walk, the more fish in the bucket.\n• A swim ring to wear, and a music shell on the sand that plays a little tune.\n• Try it on for free, then keep it for good with a one-time purchase. No subscription, no ads. Shared by your iPhone and Apple Watch, and with your family.\n• Also new: your pet's power. Your goals, steps and care earn it points every week, with Bronze, Silver, Gold and Legend ranks. On iPhone and Apple Watch.\n• And on iPhone, \"Pets of the world\": if you like, put your pet on a weekly board with pets from all over the world and see how strong it is. Only its power, its look and your country's flag go there. No name, no steps, and you can leave any time.",
